OL,6,     FRed Kites were once a thriving
OL,7,     Fspecies in Northern Ireland but
OL,8,     Fdue to disruption of their
OL,9,     Fprecious habitats, the bird went
OL,10,     Fextinct. But conservationists have
OL,11,     Freintroduced the species.
